{"title": "allow 写域名：nginx -t 直接拒绝", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "allow yourwebsite.com;"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "deny all;"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "nginx -t -c /tmp/t.conf"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "invalid parameter \"yourwebsite.com\" in /tmp/t.conf:5"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "nginx: configuration file /tmp/t.conf test failed"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "allow/deny 只认 IP/CIDR，referer 的域名匹配移植不过去"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:alpine 容器 (nginx/1.31.5)"}
]}
